# Goblin Warlord — an Intermediate enemy, the deck as the second expansion (Duels of the Planeswalkers, 1998) replaced it.
# tier: 5/12 Intermediate enemies — 18 life, bribe 80 gold
# enemy: Goblin Lord — the 1997 in-game name (s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES); the deck file, s30 and the wiki call it "Goblin Warlord"
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Duels of the Planeswalkers (second expansion; no colour-keyed sideboard sections)
# source: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Intermediate) — "Goblin Warlord (Duels of
#   the Planeswalkers)" [Tier-web — no local copy of the Duels enemy files exists in
#   ../shandalar-src, ../s30 or ../mage-go; the wiki lists this variant for 25 of the 55
#   enemies]
# group: Duels of the Planeswalkers
